in any exchange-traded fund involves the risk that you may lose part or all of the money you invest.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span id="xdx_909_eoef--RiskTextBlock_c20260205__20260205__dei--LegalEntityAxis__custom--S000098707Member__oef--RiskAxis__oef--RiskMoneyMarketFundPriceFluctuatesMember_z7yzZVxi8ne4"&gt;Over
